784	    // ── Local-only "forget" escape hatch ──────────────────────────────────────
785	    //
786	    // For an identity whose PDS account no longer exists (deleted elsewhere / migrated
787	    // away), `forget_identity_locally` must wipe local state with no network step and
788	    // clear any stale pending-removal marker.
