830	    // 404 on the audit-log fetch, leaving the wipe (gated behind a submit that can never
831	    // succeed) unrun and the pending marker uncleared — the account gone, its single-use
832	    // email code spent, and every launch re-offering a doomed retry. These pin the branch
833	    // that makes that state unreachable.
